{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core of Magic is set in a high fantasy world where you can play as a mage, druid, or blood summoner, killing monsters, collecting loot, and solving quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The game world consists of leveling hubs where you can wait for monsters to spawn, but there is also a small overall world where you can do quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Wilderness areas become available by completing quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*The game world consists of 3 acts that become available to you as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>How many quests are there? And what futures?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 13 main quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 11 side quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 Uber quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- the game has more than 400 items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Items in the game include white, magic, unique, and rare types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a03 difficulty settings: Normal, Nightmare, Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Note: There are no microtransactions in the game despite it being free to play</u></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644210?t=1769632547","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644210?t=1769632547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644210/c26b93865d55e39ff80e00dc40c2348d8c75350b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769632547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644210/c26b93865d55e39ff80e00dc40c2348d8c75350b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769632547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core of Magic is set in a high 